
### Agents

| Agent | Provider | Role | Tools |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| @sol-triager | Claude Code | Investigator | read, grep, log_query |
| @sol-fixer | Codex | Proposer | write, branch, commit |
| @sol-verifier | OpenCode | Verifier | test_run only |

### How It Works - Real Workflow

1.  **Human:** `@sol-triager investigate login fails on /api/login`
2.  **Triager:** Posts root cause + files: `auth.js:42, token expired`
3.  **Human:** `@sol-fixer propose fix for #123`
4.  **Fixer:** Creates branch `fix/login-123`, posts diff, asks for approval. CANNOT merge.
5.  **Human:** `@sol-verifier verify fix/login-123`
6.  **Verifier:** Runs `npm test`, posts receipt: `12/12 tests passed`
7.  **Human:** `approve` -> Only then merge is allowed.

### Setup - Run in 10 Mins

```bash
# 1. Install Switch
curl -fsSL https://get.switch.sh | sh

# 2. Clone this repo
git clone https://github.com/YOUR-USERNAME/sol-connect-switch-workflow
cd sol-connect-switch-workflow

# 3. Create room (Discord bridge)
switch room create sol-connect-room --bridge discord

# 4. Add agents
switch agent add sol-triager --provider claude-code
switch agent add sol-fixer --provider codex
switch agent add sol-verifier --provider opencode

# 5. Launch
switch launch --config switch.yaml